*> vybe-test: cobol/class_clause/class_clause_runtime_evaluate
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_class_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLS13.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    CLASS FLAG-CLASS IS "Y" "N".
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 CH PIC X VALUE "Y".
01 RES PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CH IS FLAG-CLASS DISPLAY "F"
        WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "O"
    END-EVALUATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "F" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "F"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [F] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

